 &gt;RAGAS: Evaluation Framework for RAG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-reranker-base" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;BGE Re-ranker on Hugging Face&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>